I think about the man's explanation.
So I go to the crossing and then to the left.
Then I walk straight ahead along the street.
After a few minutes I see water.
That is the river.
The Spree lies directly in front of me.
The water is dark and quiet.
I see a bridge over the river.
I go to the bridge.
I walk over the bridge to Museum Island.
Finally I am at my destination.
I stop and look up.
The buildings here are huge.
The museums look fantastic.
Then I see the Berliner Dom.
The church is huge and very beautiful.
Sabine is right, this place is wonderful.
